@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam classBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 42
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

title AFTER MVP — Data — provider identities and local associations
entity "Provider connection" as C {
  user + provider account context
  granted capability / state
}
entity "Message / draft" as M {
  provider item / thread context
  save / send outcome
}
entity "Calendar activity" as E {
  local identity
  provider mapping if applicable
}
entity "Application association" as A {
  application identity
  permitted linked item
}
entity "Reminder" as R {
  activity context
  scheduled / actual delivery outcome
}
C ||--o{ M : P: account-scoped items
C -- E : P: selected provider mapping
A -- M : explicit local correspondence link
A -- E : explicit local activity link
E ||--o{ R : P: notification intentions
legend bottom
Conceptual ER view; not tables or foreign keys.
P = explicit working proposal, not owner acceptance.
A = established scope meaning. Unmarked counts are unspecified.
One / optional / many symbols describe relationship ends.
endlegend
@enduml
